ersonas.</span></li>
<li><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"=
>You measure everything: reply rates, call-to-demo, demo-to-trial, trial-to=
-paid, sales cycle length.</span></li>
<li><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"=
>You question the =E2=80=9Caxioms=E2=80=9D of your industry instead of copy=
ing them:</span></li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, san=
s-serif; font-size: 16px;">Do we really need SDR =E2=86=92 AE =E2=86=92 CSM=
?</span></p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"=
>Does our ICP look the same as everyone else=E2=80=99s?</span></li>
<li><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"=
>Are we sure this must be sold via demos and not self-serve?</span></li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, san=
s-serif; font-size: 16px;">At this stage, sales is less about =E2=80=9Cchar=
isma=E2=80=9D and more about building a system that learns.</span></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:175%"><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, san=
s-serif; font-size: 16px;">You=E2=80=99re not closing deals, you=E2=80=99re=
 validating or killing hypotheses.</span></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:175%"><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, san=
s-serif; font-size: 16px;">Craft come later =E2=80=93 when you already know=
 who to sell to and why they buy, but i never think that sales is an art.</=
span></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:175%"><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, san=
s-serif; font-size: 16px;">But until then, if you treat sales as science an=
d run it like a lab,</span></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:175%"><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, san=
