<p style=3D"font-size:16px; line-height:175%"><span style=3D"font-family: L=
ato, Tahoma, sans-serif;">Google just introduced Gemini 3, calling it its m=
ost intelligent and capable model so far. The new release marks a major ste=
p forward in reasoning, multimodal understanding, and autonomous agent beha=
vior. It's rolling out across Search, the Gemini app, AI Studio, Vertex AI,=
 and a new developer platform called Google Antigravity.</span></p>
<p style=3D"font-size:16px; line-height:175%"><span style=3D"font-family: L=
ato, Tahoma, sans-serif;">Gemini 3 Pro, available today in preview, shows s=
ignificant improvements across virtually every benchmark. It handles deeper=
 context, gives more direct and insight-rich answers, and can work across t=
ext, images, audio, video, and code with a 1M-token context window.&nbsp;</=
span></p>
<p style=3D"font-size:16px; line-height:175%"><span style=3D"font-family: L=
ato, Tahoma, sans-serif;">Google is also introducing Gemini 3 Deep Think, a=
n enhanced reasoning mode that outperforms even the base model on the most =
difficult evaluation tests and will come to Ultra subscribers after additio=
nal safety review. More models in the Gemini 3 series are coming soon.</spa=
n></p>
