<p style=3D"font-size:16px; line-height:175%"><span style=3D"font-family: L=
ato, Tahoma, sans-serif;">In an exclusive BBC interview, Alphabet (Google=
=E2=80=99s parent company) CEO Sundar Pichai compared today=E2=80=99s AI mo=
mentum to the 1990s internet boom =E2=80=94 rapid innovation paired with he=
avy, uneven investment. He also outlined Alphabet=E2=80=99s expansion plans=
 in the UK, the growing energy demands tied to AI development, and how majo=
r professions will adapt as AI tools become standard.</span></p>
<p style=3D"font-size:16px; line-height:175%"><span style=3D"font-family: L=
ato, Tahoma, sans-serif;"><strong>Key highlights</strong></span></p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:175%; font-size:16px">
<li style=3D"line-height: 175%;"><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, =
sans-serif;">The current AI boom includes =E2=80=9Cirrationality,=E2=80=9D =
and no company is immune to a potential market correction.</span></li>
<li style=3D"line-height: 175%;"><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, =
sans-serif;">Alphabet=E2=80=99s market value has doubled in seven months to=
 $3.5tn, driven by its full-stack AI approach (chips, models, data centers,=
 and cloud).</span></li>
<li style=3D"line-height: 175%;"><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, =
sans-serif;">The company is investing =C2=A35 billion in UK AI infrastructu=
re over the next two years and will begin training models locally at its De=
epMind unit in London.</span></li>
<li style=3D"line-height: 175%;"><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, =
sans-serif;">AI development is driving up energy demand; AI already consume=
d about 1.5% of global electricity last year, according to the Internationa=
l Energy Agency.</span></li>
<li style=3D"line-height: 175%;"><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, =
sans-serif;">Pichai expects job transitions rather than widespread eliminat=
ion, with success going to those who learn to use AI tools effectively. Pro=
fessions like teaching and medicine will evolve, not disappear.</span></li>
</ul>
